        "original_id": "7339b242-b6ec-57c7-a873-3af8f625f0e1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: TMNT (video game), TMNT (film)\n- People: Kevin Munroe, Mako\n- Concepts: release timing, platform availability, final film role\n\nFacts:\n- In July 2006, Mako died, and TMNT was his final film role.\n- TMNT is a 2007 computer-animated fantasy action film written and directed by Kevin Munroe.\n- TMNT is a single-player action-adventure multi-platform action video game starring the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles.\n- TMNT the video game is based on the 2007 film of the same name.\n- TMNT the video game was released three days before the film's release for Xbox 360, Wii, PlayStation 2, Nintendo GameCube, Nintendo DS, and PlayStation Portable, and it was released for PC on March 20, 2007.",
